  "help.q.theme": "How do I switch between light and dark mode?",
  "help.a.theme": "Use the sun/moon button in the topbar, or Settings -> Appearance. The choice persists on this device and applies to every page, including dialogs.",
  "help.q.language": "How do I change the language?",
  "help.a.language": "The EN/AR button in the topbar flips both the language and the layout direction. All views, tables and forms mirror correctly in Arabic.",
  "help.q.requests": "How are citizen requests processed?",
  "help.a.requests": "New requests land in the queue with status \"New\". Reviewers approve, reject or assign them , every change is recorded in the activity log and reflected across the dashboard immediately.",
  "help.q.export": "Can I export the activity log?",
  "help.a.export": "Open Activity, then View -> Export and pick CSV or JSON. In this demo the export is simulated , no file is downloaded.",
  "help.quote": "Masar cut our average permit turnaround from nine days to three. The queue, appointments and document center finally speak the same language.",
  "help.quoteAuthor": "Huda Al-Mutairi",
  "help.quoteSource": "Operations quarterly review",
  "help.quoteCaption": "Director of Municipal Services, demo persona",
  "help.terms": "Service terms",
  "help.termsTitle": "Terms of service",
  "help.termsIntro": "Demo terms , fictional content for layout purposes.",
  "help.termsP1": "Requests submitted through Masar are processed by the responsible municipal department within the published service-level targets. Applicants are notified of every status change through their registered contact channel.",
  "help.termsP2": "Documents uploaded to the document center remain the property of the applicant. The agency stores them only for the duration required by the relevant service and removes them afterwards.",
  "help.termsP3": "Appointments may be rescheduled or cancelled up to twenty-four hours before the booked time. Repeated no-shows may temporarily limit online booking for the affected national ID.",
  "help.termsP4": "Service fees shown in the catalog are indicative for this demo. No payment is collected anywhere in this application, and no real personal data should ever be entered.",
